# Sudden Substitution trades Bot2's Lightning Bolt for Bot1's Sphinx of False Conclusions (CR 701.12), so Bot2 controls a
# Sphinx that Bot1 owns. When Bot2 bolts it, the card goes to its owner's graveyard (CR 400.3) but "create a token that's
# a copy of it" is the ability of the Sphinx's controller when it died (CR 603.3a, 603.10a): the token arrives under
# Bot2's control and is Bot2's own. Bot1 as the new Bolt's controller aims it at Bot2 (17).

